  ;; rotate). Pre-fix this was a defbase calling
  ;; `shape/find-secret-leaf-fn-id`; now pure graph composition over
  ;; the new `:fn-names-with-tag` primitive + the existing
  ;; `:list-entities` + `:first` + `:get :id` chain. Admins can swap
  ;; which base-fn is the leaf shape by editing the `:tags` on
