  {:name :_inline-bind-target-fn-row
   :description "Read the target fn row by id; nil when not found. `:get-entity` returns nil for missing rows and nil-id input alike. `:id` is asserted non-null — upstream guards reject the request when `:fn-id` is missing. Pinned `:return-type` narrows from the opaque `[:map :keyword :any]` to `:fn-row-shape` so downstream `:get :key …` sees a typed record (docs/PARTIALS.md §10 + the `:fn-row-shape` alias in `storage.versioned`)."
